# Atlas Reactorum — CITATION.cff

cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Atlas Reactorum"
message: "If you use this atlas, please cite it, and cite the underlying sources it catalogues."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Šotek"
    given-names: "Miroslav"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-3560-0851"
    email: "protoscience@anulum.li"
    affiliation: "ANULUM / Fortis Studio"
abstract: >-
  An English-first, source-aware atlas and research library of reactor
  technology, covering nuclear fission, plasma and alternative fusion,
  chemical and biochemical reactors, hybrid systems and explicitly labelled
  speculative technologies. Physical principle, technology maturity and
  strength of evidence are recorded as separate fields. Records are publisher
  rows, not verified reactor vessels.
keywords:
  - reactors
  - nuclear fission
  - nuclear fusion
  - chemical engineering
  - research data
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/anulum/atlas-reactorum"
url: "https://anulum.github.io/atlas-reactorum/04_interactive_presentation/"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-03"
